{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033330/extras/e0667eb608275228d5a3b6242804e5ba.poster.avif?t=1761449318\" width=616 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033330/extras/e0667eb608275228d5a3b6242804e5ba.webm?t=1761449318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033330/extras/e0667eb608275228d5a3b6242804e5ba.mp4?t=1761449318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the <i>steampunk</i> kingdom of <strong>Bellochia</strong>, a land where new technologies are invented all the time! Mixing science with magic through mystical crystals known as &quot;<strong>Magie</strong>,&quot; the brilliant minds of the kingdom have been able to create fully autonomous robots!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our protagonist is the daughter of a great inventor, one of the minds behind these robots known as &quot;<strong>Autonomes</strong>&quot;. He was responsible for designing the magical cores that give life to the Autonomes, almost as complex as the human brain. Born a commoner, due to his contributions and intelligence he was granted noble titles, being able to bring comfort to his family.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033330/extras/6b85a16dd70af7290316863d7dea47a9.poster.avif?t=1761449318\" width=616 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033330/extras/6b85a16dd70af7290316863d7dea47a9.webm?t=1761449318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033330/extras/6b85a16dd70af7290316863d7dea47a9.mp4?t=1761449318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game begins after the mysterious death of our protagonist\u2019s father, and now stripped of her noble titles, she must adapt to life among commoners and attend a plebeian school. Talk, socialize, go on dates, and experience school life where every action matters and can change the outcome of this story, you'll have 28 days to find the love of your life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033330/extras/0263e3611ff8ca0ce51907e933d66096.avif?t=1761449318\" width=616 height=270 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A cheerful and energetic girl with an incredible talent for building machines, though she unfortunately uses much of her skill to create rather questionable things.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033330/extras/c64c6897daf34f2cd15301eccb93b853.avif?t=1761449318\" width=616 height=270 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">She has a more reserved personality and is the most intelligent in the entire class, usually spending her time in the library, preferring to lose herself in the magic of books rather than reality.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033330/extras/028aeca7a571b2570578905dc228a24d.avif?t=1761449318\" width=616 height=270 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A girl full of herself and very proud of belonging to a wealthy bourgeois family. Although she always tries to maintain the posture of a responsible adult, she sometimes ends up revealing her sweeter side.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033330/extras/788e48bfea502d4333059463610f1eda.avif?t=1761449318\" width=616 height=270 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A sweet and kind girl who always tries to maintain harmony wherever she goes. As the older sister of two small children, Lucy is very caring and protective toward those she loves, sometimes even showing a slightly maternal side.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033330/extras/de9cc0e954573277ab4e0c88c36a569f.avif?t=1761449318\" width=616 height=174 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful character and background art;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Various <i>CGs</i>;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully original soundtrack;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple endings;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extra content such as a <strong>music room</strong>, <i><strong>CG</strong></i><strong> gallery</strong>, <strong>bonus artwork</strong>, and <strong>developer commentary</strong>;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A <i><strong>tsundere</strong></i> robot maid.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033330/extras/a93cdc29812378b4ada9171ca015ee0a.webp?t=1761449318\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033330/extras/a93cdc29812378b4ada9171ca015ee0a.poster.avif?t=1761449318\" class=\"bb_img\" width=616 height=174 /></picture></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4033330?t=1761449318","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4033330?t=1761449318","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033330/b507e11b55d601256f2b5a02e87ec5ceb4417995/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761449318","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033330/b507e11b55d601256f2b5a02e87ec5ceb4417995/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761449318","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4064230,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033330/extras/e0667eb608275228d5a3b6242804e5ba.poster.avif?t=1761449318\" width=616 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033330/extras/e0667eb608275228d5a3b6242804e5ba.webm?t=1761449318\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4033330/extras/e0667eb608275228d5a3b6242804e5ba.mp4?t=1761449318\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the <i>steampunk</i> kingdom of <strong>Bellochia</strong>, a land where new technologies are invented all the time! Mixing science with magic through mystical crystals known as &quot;<strong>Magie</strong>,&quot; the brilliant minds of the kingdom have been able to create fully autonomous robots!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our protagonist is the daughter of a great inventor, one of t